WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
This is my Rock Paper Scissors game, developed using C++.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The game allows a player to compete against the computer.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The first player to reach 3 points wins the game.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
I select my choice: Rock, Paper, or Scissors.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The computer randomly selects its choice.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The game compares both choices and determines the round winner.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:49.000
The scores are updated after each round.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:14.000
The game continues until either the player or computer reaches 3 points.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Finally, the game announces the winner and displays the final score.